#: ../../source/legacy/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:57
msgid ""
"Feature flag. When ``true``, every key is written with an expiry (see "
"``valkey_ttl_sec``) so Valkey/Redis ``volatile-*`` eviction policies can "
"reclaim L2 cache keys once the node reaches ``maxmemory``. When ``false``"
" (default), keys are persisted without a TTL."
msgstr ""

